  "notes": "{検査|けんさ} means inspection, examination, or testing. Used across medical, industrial, and security contexts.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{検査|けんさ}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {検査|けんさ}する: to inspect/examine\n- {検査|けんさ}を{受|う}ける: to undergo an inspection/test\n- {検査|けんさ}に{合格|ごうかく}する: to pass an inspection\n- {検査|けんさ}{結果|けっか}: test results\n\nTYPES:\n- {血液|けつえき}{検査|けんさ}: blood test\n- {健康|けんこう}{診断|しんだん}/{検査|けんさ}: health checkup\n- {品質|ひんしつ}{検査|けんさ}: quality inspection\n- {手荷物|てにもつ}{検査|けんさ}: baggage inspection\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {検診|けんしん}: medical screening (preventive)\n- {診察|しんさつ}: medical examination (by a doctor)\n- {調査|ちょうさ}: investigation, survey (broader scope)",
